%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrap": true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant A as App
  participant S as Server
  U->>A: Open the page
  A->>S: GET /source
  S-->>A: the diagram text
  alt the file changed
    A->>A: re-render
  else unchanged
    A->>A: nothing to do
  end
  Note over A,S: polls every second
